{"availability":"available","full":"shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT","name":"AGRICULTURE-BOT","description":"A chat assistant for Indian farmers — ask about crop diseases, mandi prices, weather, or government schemes in your own language, get a plain-language answer. RAG-grounded so it's not guessing on pesticide dosages, with a guardrail layer keeping it scoped to farming. Advisory only.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-11T12:44:38Z","updated":"2026-09-20T13:44:31Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/suszi-2/AGRICULTURE_BOT","topics":["agriculture","chatbot","gradio","guardrails","huggingface","llm","multilingual","python","rag","tool-calling"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/suszi-2/AGRICULTURE_BOT","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:20.868Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:20.868Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T16:00:20.868Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:14:09.742Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T22:31:42.322Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T14:50:28.980Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T16:00:20.868Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A chat assistant for Indian farmers. Ask a question in your own language — about a crop disease, mandi prices, weather, or a government scheme — and get a short, plain-language answer.","Advisory only. It doesn't process transactions or government applications.","A lot of the AI-for-agriculture projects I'd seen were English-only and assumed the user was comfortable with an app or a dashboard. That's not who actually needs this — most of the people who'd benefit from quick disease diagnosis or same-day mandi prices are dealing with all of it in a regional language, often over a basic phone. So the two things I prioritized were RAG-grounded answers (so it's not guessing about pesticide dosages) and multilingual support, over adding more features. The guardrail layer came out of the same instinct — a farming bot confidently answering something outside…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9115d1e61e201ffe7469b5746e28924c73ffe9d86aff64982fa2662f657d5286","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:09.986Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:42:06.929Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A chat assistant for Indian farmers. Ask a question in your own language — about a crop disease, mandi prices, weather, or a government scheme — and get a short, plain-language answer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"This puts all of that behind one chat interface, in the farmer's own language, with no app install or login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9115d1e61e201ffe7469b5746e28924c73ffe9d86aff64982fa2662f657d5286","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T22:42:06.929Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-20T13:44:31Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shakshi-soni/AGRICULTURE-BOT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T22:42:06.929Z","hash":"9115d1e61e201ffe7469b5746e28924c73ffe9d86aff64982fa2662f657d5286","originalBytes":5742,"storedBytes":5742,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:14:09.742Z","subjects":["Chatbots & assistants"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Chatbots & assistants"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chatbot"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["MCP servers & agents","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequire